    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"Is Playlist Bot B's data balanced? Find four counts to answer it. In the table, each record shows as one row.\\n- Songs before 2025 (**Before 2025** is **Yes**)\\n- Bangers before 2025 (**Label** is **Banger**)\\n- Songs from 2025 on (**Before 2025** is **No**)\\n- Bangers from 2025 on (**Label** is **Banger**)\\n\\n1. Click **Table** to see all the records.\\n2. Use the sort button and **Filter** to find your four counts.\\n3. Write the four counts in the four boxes in your guide.\\n4. Circle balanced or unbalanced.\\n5. Write one reason that compares your counts.\\n\\nYou're done when your guide has four counts, one circle and one reason.\"\r\n}"
